{"unit_id":"CrombastiC__dsh-macos-notify#card-zh","repo":"CrombastiC/dsh-macos-notify","commit":"a325410c77f36f68fba93a3124153e16bcbf6834","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-macos-notify 是面向 DSH Web 的 macOS 系统通知插件，可在任务完成、失败、阻止或等待工具审批时提醒用户。它监听会话事件，并可通过系统通知或兼容终端的 OSC 9 发送提醒；Web 设置页提供事件开关、声音选择、勿扰时段、项目规则、暂停、诊断和自定义声音管理。通知可按时间、页面焦点、键鼠空闲状态过滤，也能合并并汇总并行任务或抑制重复错误。适合希望离开 DSH 页面后仍收到任务进度提醒的 macOS 用户；需要 macOS、Node.js 22 及 DSH Web profile，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:813-882","index.js:713-810","client.js:248-255"]}
{"unit_id":"CrombastiC__dsh-macos-notify#card-en","repo":"CrombastiC/dsh-macos-notify","commit":"a325410c77f36f68fba93a3124153e16bcbf6834","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-macos-notify sends macOS alerts for completed, failed, blocked, or approval-waiting DSH turns. Its Web panel configures sounds, quiet hours, project rules, pauses, diagnostics, and custom sounds. Alerts can be filtered, coalesced, or digested. Requires macOS, Node.js 22, and DSH Web; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:813-882","index.js:713-810","client.js:248-255"]}
